     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"SL\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Nova verzija RStudio (0.98.484 ) zanimivo razširitev: R presentations, ki temeljijo na Markdown in knitr.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Omogoča pripravo HTML5 celozaslonskih predstavitev - podobno kot Beamer paket v LaTeX.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/ide/docs/presentations/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/ide/docs/presentations/overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237378183000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3IOF6tmMMRSkDIpQvTtmI2\">http://www.rstudio.com/ide/docs/presentations/overview</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Andrej<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">--<br>\r\nAndrej Blejec<br>\r\nNational Institute of Biology<br>\r\nVecna pot 111 POB 141, SI-1000 Ljubljana, SLOVENIA<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">e-mail:\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">andrej...@nib.si</a><br>\r\nURL: <a href=\"http://ablejec.nib.si/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ablejec.nib.si/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237378183000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3loLjXL1A7Qd5PVyuvGiHN\">http://ablejec.nib.si</a> <br>\r\ntel: + 386 (0)59 232 789<br>\r\nfax: <a href=\"tel:+386%201%20241%2029%2080\" value=\"+38612412980\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+ 386 1 241 29 80</a><br>\r\n--------------------------<br>\r\nOrganizer of<br>\r\nApplied Statistics 2013 conference<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"><a href=\"http://conferences.nib.si/AS2013\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://confere